post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'

  Otakase installed. Two optional extras:

    otakase -install-keybind    Super+Shift+A opens the rofi menu with previews
    otk                         short alias for otakase

  The keybinding is not set up automatically: a package is installed as root
  with no user context, so it cannot write to your Hyprland config, and a
  package that tried would be doing something it has no business doing. Run
  the command above as yourself. It backs the file up first, refuses to take
  a key something else already uses, and `-remove-keybind` undoes it.

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
